       COPY VCOMAREA IN COPYLIB.
009100 01  FORMFILE.
009200     05  FORM-FNAME                PIC X(7)  VALUE "FUDCSTR".
009300     05  FILLER                    PIC X     VALUE ".".
009400     05  FORM-GNAME.
009500         10  FORM-GNAME1           PIC X(5)  VALUE "FLANG".
009600         10  FORM-GNAME2           PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
009700     05  FILLER                    PIC X(19) VALUE SPACES.
009800
009900 01  TERMFILENAME         PIC X(11) VALUE "TERMLIST;".
010000
010100 01  MESSAGE-BUFLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE 76      COMP-4.
010200
